{"suttaId":"an3.183-352","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iii","vriCode":"s0402m2.mul","paras":[1321,1336],"vripara":"184"},"segments":{"an3.183-352:0.3":"(18) 8. Rāgapeyyālaṃ","an3.183-352:1.1":"“Rāgassa, bhikkhave, abhiññāya tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā.","an3.183-352:1.2":"Katame tayo?","an3.183-352:1.3":"Suññato samādhi, animitto samādhi, appaṇihito samādhi –","an3.183-352:1.4":"rāgassa, bhikkhave, abhiññāya ime tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā.()[(rāgassa bhikkhave abhiññāya tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā. katame tayo? savitakkasavicāro samādhi, avitakkavicāramatto samādhi, avitakkaavicāro samādhi. rāgassa bhikkhave abhiññāya ime tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā.) etthantare pāṭho katthaci dissati, aṭṭhakathāyaṃ passitabbo]","an3.183-352:2.1":"“Rāgassa, bhikkhave, pariññāya … pe …","an3.183-352:2.2":"parikkhayāya …","an3.183-352:2.3":"pahānāya …","an3.183-352:2.4":"khayāya …","an3.183-352:2.5":"vayāya …","an3.183-352:2.6":"virāgāya …","an3.183-352:2.7":"nirodhāya …","an3.183-352:2.8":"cāgāya …","an3.183-352:2.9":"paṭinissaggāya ime tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā.","an3.183-352:3.1":"“Dosassa …","an3.183-352:3.2":"mohassa …","an3.183-352:3.3":"kodhassa …","an3.183-352:3.4":"upanāhassa …","an3.183-352:3.5":"makkhassa … palāsassa …","an3.183-352:3.7":"issāya …","an3.183-352:3.8":"macchariyassa …","an3.183-352:3.9":"māyāya …","an3.183-352:3.10":"sāṭheyyassa …","an3.183-352:3.11":"thambhassa …","an3.183-352:3.12":"sārambhassa …","an3.183-352:3.13":"mānassa …","an3.183-352:3.14":"atimānassa …","an3.183-352:3.15":"madassa …","an3.183-352:3.16":"pamādassa","an3.183-352:3.17":"abhiññāya …","an3.183-352:3.18":"pariññāya …","an3.183-352:3.19":"parikkhayāya …","an3.183-352:3.20":"pahānāya …","an3.183-352:3.21":"khayāya …","an3.183-352:3.22":"vayāya …","an3.183-352:3.23":"virāgāya …","an3.183-352:3.24":"nirodhāya …","an3.183-352:3.25":"cāgāya …","an3.183-352:3.26":"paṭinissaggāya ime tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā”ti.","an3.183-352:4.1":"(Idamavoca bhagavā.","an3.183-352:4.2":"Attamanā te bhikkhū bhagavato bhāsitaṃ abhinandunti.)[() etthantare pāṭho syā. kaṃ. ka. potthakesu na dissati]","an3.183-352:4.3":"Rāgapeyyālaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.","an3.183-352:5.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an3.183-352:5.1":"[imā uddānagāthāyo sī. syā. kaṃ. pī. potthakesu na dissanti] Rāgaṃ dosañca mohañca,","an3.183-352:5.2":"kodhūpanāhapañcamaṃ;","an3.183-352:5.3":"Makkhapaḷāsaissā ca,","an3.183-352:5.4":"maccharimāyāsāṭheyyā.","an3.183-352:6.1":"Thambhasārambhamānañca,","an3.183-352:6.2":"atimānamadassa ca;","an3.183-352:6.3":"Pamādā sattarasa vuttā,","an3.183-352:6.4":"rāgapeyyālanissitā.","an3.183-352:7.1":"Ete opammayuttena,","an3.183-352:7.2":"āpādena abhiññāya;","an3.183-352:7.3":"Pariññāya parikkhayā,","an3.183-352:7.4":"pahānakkhayabbayena;","an3.183-352:7.5":"Virāganirodhacāgaṃ,","an3.183-352:7.6":"paṭinissagge ime dasa.","an3.183-352:8.1":"Suññato animitto ca,","an3.183-352:8.2":"appaṇihito ca tayo;","an3.183-352:8.3":"Samādhimūlakā peyyā","an3.183-352:8.4":"lesupi vavatthitā cāti.","an3.183-352:8.5":"Tikanipātapāḷi niṭṭhitā."},"unsure":["an3.183-352:3.5","an3.183-352:8.5"],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-iii","bookName":"Tikanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":991,"to":991,"paras":[{"para":991,"vripara":"164-184","refs":["an3.183-352:1"],"lines":["164-184. <b>Samanuñño</b>ti samānajjhāsayo.","<b>Rāgassā</b>ti pañcakāmaguṇikarāgassa.","<b>Abhiññāyā</b>ti abhijānanatthaṃ.","<b>Suññato samādhī</b>tiādīhi tīhipi samādhīhi vipassanāva kathitā.","Vipassanā hi niccābhinivesa-niccanimitta-niccapaṇidhiādīnaṃ abhāvā imāni nāmāni labhati.","<b>Pariññāyā</b>ti parijānanatthaṃ.","Sesapadesupi eseva nayoti."],"lineRefs":[["an3.183-352:1"],["an3.183-352:1"],["an3.183-352:1"],["an3.183-352:1"],["an3.183-352:1"],["an3.183-352:1"],["an3.183-352:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"after":[{"para":992,"vripara":null,"title":"Peyyālavaggādivaṇṇanā","lines":["Peyyālavaggādi niṭṭhitā."]},{"para":993,"vripara":null,"title":"Peyyālavaggādivaṇṇanā","lines":["Manorathapūraṇiyā aṅguttaranikāya-aṭṭhakathāya"]},{"p